      "topic": "Construct chains",
      "example": "מַלְכֵי־אֶרֶץ; שֹׁפְטֵי אָרֶץ; אַפְסֵי־אָרֶץ",
      "note": "Construct forms encode genitive relationships; note semantic range of אֶרֶץ (land/earth) depending on context."
    },
