      "topic": "Imperatives as rhetorical pivot",
      "example": "הַשְׂכִּילוּ … הִוָּסְרוּ; עִבְדוּ … וְגִילוּ",
      "note": "The psalm shifts from narration to direct address using 2mp imperatives, functioning as warning and invitation."
    },
